flowchart TD
    ROOT["ROOT GOAL:\nObtain PAYROLL_WRITE access\nwithout legitimate authorization\n(OR)"]

    ROOT --> A["Path A: Compromise an account\nthat already holds PAYROLL_WRITE\nor PAYROLL_APPROVE (OR)"]
    ROOT --> B["Path B: Exploit a flawed\nauthorization check (OR)"]
    ROOT --> C["Path C: Abuse the legitimate\naccess-request workflow (OR)"]
    ROOT --> D["Path D: Compromise infrastructure\ndirectly (OR)"]

    A --> A1["A1: Credential stuffing\n/ brute-force login (AND:\nvalid email + guessable password\nwithin lockout threshold)"]
    A --> A2["A2: Real-time phishing relay\n(password + TOTP code) (AND:\nconvincing lure + victim acts\nwithin 30s TOTP window)"]
    A --> A3["A3: Steal session cookie\nvia XSS (AND: find XSS vector\n+ cookie readable by JS)"]
    A --> A4["A4: Steal refresh token\nfrom browser storage\n(AND: physical/malware access\nto victim device)"]

    B --> B1["B1: Call role-assignment endpoint\ndirectly, bypass UI self-check\n(AND: find endpoint + no\nlive server-side re-verification)"]
    B --> B2["B2: Approve own access request\n(AND: already hold an unrelated\nAPPROVE permission on same\nresource + no requester!=reviewer check)"]
    B --> B3["B3: Forge JWT permissions claim\n(AND: obtain JWT_SECRET)"]

    C --> C1["C1: Submit request, then\nsocial-engineer a legitimate\napprover into approving it"]
    C --> C2["C2: Race condition — submit\nmany requests hoping one slips\nthrough before a role/permission\nchange revokes approver authority"]

    D --> D1["D1: Exfiltrate .env / DATABASE_URL\nfrom server or CI secrets store"]
    D --> D2["D2: Directly write to\nuser_permissions table\nvia leaked DB credentials"]

